        "english_translation": "Today was Sunday, and I did not know whether the ramen shop was closed. But I wanted ramen, so I walked to the shop. On the way, I thought about what to order. I thought I would eat two bowls of ramen and drink beer too. When I arrived in front of the shop, there was a big piece of paper on the door. \"We are closed today.\" I stood in front of the door for a while. My stomach rumbled loudly. At a small convenience store nearby, I bought bread or something. On the way home, there was another shop. Through the window, I could see the ramen shop's owner. That person was eating two bowls of ramen. I walked home eating my bread.",
