        "english_translation": "Last week, I went to a curry shop with a friend. That shop is near the station, and there are always many customers. My friend said, \"The curry here is very delicious.\" My friend comes here every week. I ordered the biggest curry. A red curry came. When I ate the curry, it was so spicy that I cried right away. My mouth and my body became hot. I drank six glasses of water, so much that my stomach got big. So there was no room left for ice cream. My friend did not say anything. My friend's face was red, and the eyes were red too. But my friend ate all of the curry while crying. At the end, my friend smiled a little and said. \"Today it is less spicy than before.\"",
